# Policy Compliance env template (local)

Copy to `.env.local`. Match portal embed secret.

```bash
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

# Must match portal POLICY_EMBED_SECRET
POLICY_EMBED_SECRET=

# Local data: data/local/db.json (gitignored). Refresh via npm run data:refresh
# USE_REMOTE_STORE=1   # only for intentional remote; never Production write experiments
```
